{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zongshi-e-o083","title":"翊后卒为左右边鸿所杀，鸿亦即诛","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-84e6d7ec14448efe1fdc","label":"正文","text":"翊后卒为左右边鸿所杀，鸿亦即诛","evidence":["zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-b0c1d0c399c963847b2f","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"妫览、戴员亲近边鸿等数为翊所困，常欲叛逆；因吴主出征，遂其奸计","evidence":["zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-98dcb7cdaa423d101862","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"翊以妻徐氏颇晓卜，入语徐：吾明日欲为长吏作主人，卿试卜之；徐言卦不能佳，可须异日；翊以长吏来久宜速遣，乃大请宾客","evidence":["zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-48cfba6008fdeee9d984","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"翊出入常持刀，尔时有酒色，空手送客；鸿从后斫翊，郡中扰乱，无救翊者，遂为鸿所杀，迸走入山","evidence":["zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0028","role":"被杀者；所困之主（背景）；问卜设宴者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8","zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0048","role":"杀翊而被诛者；欲叛者；斫翊者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"欲叛者","evidence":["zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"欲叛者","evidence":["zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"出征（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0041","role":"试卜者","evidence":["zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8","zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","source_order":[51,147,20],"order":9190},{"id":"zongshi-e-o090","title":"初，孙权杀吴郡太守盛宪，宪故孝廉妫览、戴员亡匿山中","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-30936b89c29606f62179","label":"正文","text":"初，孙权杀吴郡太守盛宪，宪故孝廉妫览、戴员亡匿山中","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-a7d45956dffb8cd4a81b","label":"裴注·会稽典录","text":"孙策平定吴、会，诛其英豪；宪素有高名，策深忌之","evidence":["zongshi-q-dbb438b878a578ec1b52"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-168a632fb900856bfd76","label":"裴注·会稽典录","text":"由是征宪为骑都尉；制命未至，果为权所害","evidence":["zongshi-q-7faab9ab15f630ab949e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"杀盛宪者；害宪者","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","zongshi-q-7faab9ab15f630ab949e"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0079","role":"被杀者；被忌者；受征而被害者","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","zongshi-q-dbb438b878a578ec1b52","zongshi-q-7faab9ab15f630ab949e"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"亡匿者","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"亡匿者","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"诛英豪而忌宪者","evidence":["zongshi-q-dbb438b878a578ec1b52"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","zongshi-q-dbb438b878a578ec1b52","zongshi-q-7faab9ab15f630ab949e"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","source_order":[51,174,12],"order":9204},{"id":"zongshi-e-o091","title":"孙翊为丹杨太守，皆礼致妫览、戴员；览为丹杨都尉督兵，员为郡丞","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-08bee46e278115c58efe","label":"正文","text":"孙翊为丹杨太守，皆礼致妫览、戴员；览为丹杨都尉督兵，员为郡丞","evidence":["zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0028","role":"礼致者","evidence":["zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"受礼任都尉督兵者","evidence":["zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"受礼任郡丞者","evidence":["zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4","source_order":[51,174,44],"order":9205},{"id":"zongshi-e-o092","title":"及翊遇害，河驰赴宛陵，责怒览、员以不能全（权）〔翊〕，令使奸变得施","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-0668b7b0a3cba1156a6a","label":"正文","text":"及翊遇害，河驰赴宛陵，责怒览、员以不能全（权）〔翊〕，令使奸变得施","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0040","role":"驰赴责怒者","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"被责者","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"被责者","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0028","role":"遇害者（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","source_order":[51,174,78],"order":9206},{"id":"zongshi-e-o093","title":"览、员议曰伯海与将军疏远而责我乃（耳）〔尔〕，讨虏若来吾属无遗矣；遂杀河，使人北迎扬州刺史刘馥，令住历阳，以丹杨应之","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-b5b051a213365649f4d3","label":"正文","text":"览、员议曰伯海与将军疏远而责我乃（耳）〔尔〕，讨虏若来吾属无遗矣；遂杀河，使人北迎扬州刺史刘馥，令住历阳，以丹杨应之","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"议而杀河迎馥者","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"议而杀河迎馥者","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0040","role":"被杀者","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]},{"person":"liusima-p0010","role":"被北迎者","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938","source_order":[51,174,118],"order":9207},{"id":"zongshi-e-o094","title":"会翊帐下徐元、孙高、傅婴等杀览、员","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-fe8845b35557640ae2f2","label":"正文","text":"会翊帐下徐元、孙高、傅婴等杀览、员","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-8ddceacfedcf8ec3dc24","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"徐氏购募追捕，中宿乃得；览、员归罪杀鸿","evidence":["zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-b1bbf396e5634191fff8","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"诸将皆知览、员所为而力不能讨；览入居军府中，悉取翊嫔妾及左右侍御，欲复取徐；徐绐之曰乞须晦日设祭除服","evidence":["zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-2faf0bb633cec23050b6","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"时月垂竟，览听须祭毕；徐潜使所亲信语翊旧将孙高、傅婴等：览已虏略婢妾今又欲见逼，欲立微计，愿二君哀救；高、婴涕泣答言受府君恩遇，今日之事实夙夜所怀","evidence":["zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-4b2afda87c3034d97d5f","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"乃密呼翊时侍养者二十余人，以徐意语之，共盟誓合谋","evidence":["zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-97b5a304b6b1fa889833","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"到晦日设祭；徐氏哭泣尽哀毕，乃徐服、熏香沐浴，更于他室安施帏帐，言笑欢悦示无戚容；览密觇视，无复疑意","evidence":["zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-ff459a75a2dca80b6ca2","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"徐呼高、婴与诸婢罗住户内，使人报览说已除凶即吉；览盛意入，徐出户拜；览适得一拜，徐便大呼二君可起；高、婴俱出共得杀览；余人即就外杀员","evidence":["zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-68877fcb44eb9847b8c8","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"夫人乃还缞绖，奉览、员首以祭翊墓；举军震骇，以为神异","evidence":["zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-c382b2d2a67403796451","label":"裴注·吴历","text":"吴主续至，悉族诛览、员余党；擢高、婴为牙门；其余皆加赐金帛，殊其门户","evidence":["zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zongshi-p0040","role":"杀览员者","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0038","role":"杀览员者；泣答共谋者；盟誓者；出而杀览者；受擢牙门者","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0001","role":"杀览员者；泣答共谋者；盟誓者；出而杀览者；受擢牙门者","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0005","role":"被杀者；归罪杀鸿者；居府取妾而欲取徐者；觇视而中计者（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7","zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0042","role":"被杀者；归罪杀鸿者","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0041","role":"购募者；绐之者；密遣信者；谋主；设祭诱敌者；设计主杀者；祭夫者","evidence":["zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7","zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0048","role":"被捕杀者","evidence":["zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0028","role":"墓被祭者（背景）","evidence":["zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"族诛擢赏者","evidence":["zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7","zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7","zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","source_order":[51,174,200],"order":9208}],"persons":[{"id":"zongshi-p0042","name":"戴员","evidence":["zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4","zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938","zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zongshi-q-02273604f428006e07b4","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"孙翊为丹杨〖4〗，皆礼致之。览为丹杨都尉督兵〖5〗，员为郡丞","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-023f5437b202ea0123d7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"诸将皆知览、员所为，而力不能讨。览入居军府中，悉取翊嫔妾及左右侍御。欲复取徐，恐逆之见害，乃绐之曰：‘乞须晦日，设祭除服","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":183,"end":243,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-06cb38c40c30257ca0a5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"妫览、戴员亲近边鸿等，数为翊所困，常欲叛逆；因吴主出征，遂其奸计","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":10,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-123a16ed7398c9e69dac","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"及翊遇害，河驰赴宛陵〖7〗；责怒览、员以不能全（权）〔翊〕〖8〗，令使奸变得施","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-38e3831bb79e583e86b5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"会翊帐下徐元、孙高、傅婴等杀览、员","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":200,"end":217,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-3e8edb90a9f2ff6715f8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"初，孙权杀吴郡太守盛宪，﹝二﹞宪故孝廉妫览、戴员亡匿山中","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-5cae10fb73526a68fd7f","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"到晦日，设祭；徐氏哭泣尽哀毕，乃徐服，熏香沐浴；更于他室，安施帏帐，言笑欢悦，示无戚容。大小凄怆，怪其如此。览密觇视，无复疑意","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":405,"end":468,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-6c296446abde8dae28e8","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"翊以妻徐氏颇晓卜，翊入语徐：‘吾明日欲为长吏作主人，卿试卜之。’徐言：‘卦不能佳！可须异日。’翊以长吏来久，宜速遣，乃大请宾客","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":54,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-7faab9ab15f630ab949e","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-594db5b5c8eb82286301","layer":"pei","quote":"由是征为骑都尉。制命未至，果为权所害","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f0a6965846e7365d7314","start":516,"end":534,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-b5917c4ae17a2c4d11ea","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"吴主续至，悉族诛览、员余党；擢高、婴为牙门；其余皆加赐金帛，殊其门户","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":578,"end":612,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-b7c66ed0bd6d185d3ce7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"徐氏购募追捕，中宿乃得，览、员归罪杀鸿","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":163,"end":182,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-c9387adcb31248735ccc","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-51c9737905162f0e6527","layer":"original","quote":"后卒为左右边鸿所杀，鸿亦即诛","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d1a125929176ccc56336","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"徐呼高、婴与诸婢罗住户内，使人报览，说：‘已除凶即吉，惟府君敕命。’览盛意入，徐出户拜。览适得一拜，徐便大呼：‘二君可起！’高、婴俱出，共得杀览；余人即就外杀员","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":469,"end":549,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-d6ff96725d7ebcf306dd","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"乃密呼翊时侍养者二十余人，以徐意语之；共盟誓，合谋","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":379,"end":404,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-dbb438b878a578ec1b52","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-594db5b5c8eb82286301","layer":"pei","quote":"孙策平定吴、会，诛其英豪；宪素有高名，策深忌之","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f0a6965846e7365d7314","start":43,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"夫人乃还缞绖，奉览、员首，以祭翊墓。举军震骇，以为神异","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":550,"end":577,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"时月垂竟，览听须祭毕。徐潜使所亲信，语翊亲近旧将孙高、傅婴等，说：‘览已虏略婢妾，今又欲见逼；所以外许之者，欲安其意以免祸耳。欲立微计，愿二君哀救！’高、婴涕泣答言：‘受府君恩遇，所以不即死难者，以死无益，欲思惟事计；事计未立，未敢启夫人耳。今日之事，实夙夜所怀也","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":245,"end":377,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-f9675961290df4357938","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b01cfcdeadd92ea5d12f","layer":"original","quote":"二人议曰：“伯海与将军疏远〖9〗，而责我乃（耳）〔尔〕〖10〗；讨虏若来〖11〗，吾属无遗矣〖12〗！”遂杀河，使人北迎扬州刺史刘馥〖13〗；令住历阳，以丹杨应之","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":118,"end":199,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"翊出入常持刀，尔时有酒色，空手送客；鸿从后斫翊，郡中扰乱，无救翊者：遂为鸿所杀，迸走入山","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":118,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
